  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n frac{{{{( {{{r - s}}} )}{³}}{{ + }}{{( {{{s - t}}} )}{³}}{{ + }}{{( {{{t - r}}} )}{³}}}}{{{{6}}( {{{r - s}}} )( {{{s - t}}} )( {{{t - r}}} )}}\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nIf a + b + c = 0, then a³ + b³ + c³ - 3abc = 0.\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nAccording to question,\n\n⇒ (r - s) + (s - t) + (t - r) = 0\n\nSo, frac{{{{( {{{r - s}}} )}{³}}{{ + }}{{( {{{s - t}}} )}{³}}{{ + }}{{( {{{t - r}}} )}{³}}}}{{{{6}}( {{{r - s}}} )( {{{s - t}}} )( {{{t - r}}} )}}\n\n⇒ (3(r-s)(s-t)(t-r))/(6(r-s)(s-t)(t-r)) = (1)/(2)\n\n∴ **The value of frac{{{{( {{{r - s}}} )}{³}}{{ + }}{{( {{{s - t}}} )}{³}}{{ + }}{{( {{{t - r}}} )}{³}}}}{{{{6}}( {{{r - s}}} )( {{{s - t}}} )( {{{t - r}}} )}}is (1)/(2).**",
